WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:03.590
My passionate idol activities,

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:07.130
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:10.940
So far on Aikatsu!

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:16.160
A new idol school called Dream Academy, or DreAca for short, has popped up.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:22.710
We got to know Otoshiro Seira-chan, an idol who goes there, and her producer, Saegusa Kii-chan.

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:28.090
Since we got to know all these new people, 
our Aikatsu has gotten a lot more passionate.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:34.980
Ok-ok-okay!

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:38.010
Actually, more like yum-yum-yummy!

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.570
Right, so "yummy" is...

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:44.050
...a word children use in English to say "delicious", right?

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:45.020
You knew?

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:49.520
You always say it when you eat 
Pon Pon Crepes, so I looked it up. {lowercase c?}{I think the whole thing is a proper noun}

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:52.350
You're such a study bug, Seira.

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:54.150
Here's a question for you.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.890
Who is the 14th-generation Pon Pon Crepe image girl?

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.660
I didn't go that far...

00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:02.910
The answer is...

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:06.540
Kiriya Aoi-chan from Starlight Academy!

00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:09.910
She fits the role perfectly.

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:11.890
I know, I know, I know!

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:16.240
If it were up to me, I'd pick her too!

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.430
I wonder who the next one'll be.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:19.430
The next one?

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:21.810
It's coming up.

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:23.760
They're having an audition for it.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:28.190
Yum-yum-yummy!

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:29.530
Kii.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.820
Why don't you give the audition a try?

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:36.570
I think you'd be a perfect Pon Pon Crepe image girl.

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.100
No way, no way, no way!

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:42.010
I'm a producer, not an idol.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:45.330
I think you'd make it, though.

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:26.680
It's almost time to retire this poster.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:29.210
It really makes you reflect.

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:31.690
I remember that audition like it was yesterday! {or like, something more literal}

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:37.190
I couldn't believe I got to be the Pon Pon Crepe image girl, just like Mizuki-chan was.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.820
I wonder who the next one will be.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:43.950
As the 14th-generation image girl, I can hardly wait!

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.820
Otoshiro Seira-chan!

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:50.500
It's the first time I've seen her so close!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.670
So cute!

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:52.750
She's cool, too.

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.440
The girl next to her is cute, too.

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:56.750
Yeah, but if I remember correctly...

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.760
The theme for Seira's next outfit...

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:03.010
Yeah, she really is cute. {even if it's a bit odd, just assume Kii only hears the "cute" part}

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:06.650
You want to go with a cute one? {I think 路線 is a technical word that's a property of a card -- like they can be cute, cool, etc.}

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:08.390
No, I was talking about you.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:15.900
Today, you will be writing a report on why you decided to become an idol.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:20.390
Please use this opportunity to reaffirm your aspirations.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:26.160
Why did Kii want to be a producer?

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:32.790
Can you come by my office later?

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:37.540
You have tons of flowers and fan mail from your fans.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:39.750
It's all thanks to Kii's producing.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.210
Good for you.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:42.850
You have a wonderful producer.

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:43.930
I do.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:49.600
Love you!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.720
They just announced it!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.940
The Pon Pon Crepe audition!

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:55.440
Oh?

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.730
Otome-chan, are you entering?

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:00.810
I'd love to, but I have so much work...

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:06.380
And Ichigo doesn't have time on her schedule for it either...

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:07.450
What about you, Ran?

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:11.120
No thanks, I'm not exactly a "Pon Pon" kind of girl...

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.330
Really?

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:15.250
Besides, I have a photo shoot for a magazine that day.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.740
I see.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.960
What about you, Yurika-chan? {this feels better?}

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:23.260
I'd like to, but that's the day of the Black Mass.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.920
Oh, so you have a concert.

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:28.760
Kaede, Sakura, and Shion can't do it either. {I always type "Shino" when I try to type Shion now}

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.510
The next image girl is a mystery!

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:33.700
The anticipation is killing me!

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.390
This is really special!

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:39.610
Are they all from fans?{uh...}

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.650
Looks like they sent it to the school.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:45.200
It's not even your birthday, and you're getting so many presents.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:46.650
You're amazing, Seira!

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:48.660
It's all thanks to you.

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:51.070
No, you worked hard for this.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:52.910
Oh, and this.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.660
The headmistress told me to give it to you.

00:05:56.820 --> 00:05:58.660
Ah, it's from Mama!

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.840
It's Number 37! {leaving a note that etoce can't into numbers}

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:07.310
Number 37?

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:08.840
It's one of Mama's handmade accessories.

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:11.640
She used to give them all names,

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:15.020
but after fifteen of them, we started using numbers.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.330
She's made a lot of them.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.520
But seriously, Mama...

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:25.950
She knows how busy she is, yet she stayed up making these!

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.030
I'll tell her to sleep properly in an email. {length}

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:32.360
Oh, but she can't get any now.

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:33.910
Not for a week, at least.

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:38.190
Your mom lives really far away, right?

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:38.920
Yeah.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:41.850
On an island where she's the only doctor.

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:44.420
You must not get to see her very often.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:46.510
I'm never lonely, though.

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:49.180
We're connected no matter how far apart we are.

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:51.680
It's totally ok-ok-okay!

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:55.650
Mama's accessories are really cute. {really are?}

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:00.650
Kii.

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:04.660
What, what, what?!

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.690
I just felt like taking one.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.200
Ow!

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:15.940
There are so many girls participating in the Pon Pon Crepe audition this year.

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:16.700
Huh?

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.830
I feel like this is going to be intense!

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:26.120
They're here, they're here, they're here!

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:27.820
What's here?

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:31.380
Images of hair accessories that you'd look good in.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:37.100
I put in things like the shape of your head, the balance of your face, and the qualities of your hair,

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.350
and it spits back all sorts of designs.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.760
That's great and all,

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:43.810
but why don't you go try that on?

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.470
The hair accessory that your mom made.

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.020
Your hair is so soft!

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:52.860
Isn't it?

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:54.990
Mama did her best to take care of it.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:58.170
She said it too delicate and hard to tie up.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.120
I can understand.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.960
You're good at this, Seira.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:04.130
I'm a bit surprised.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:07.120
I used to braid my sister's hair all the time.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:09.260
Really? I didn't know.

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:11.270
All done.

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:13.760
Thank you!

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:15.100
Your mom's great.

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:17.460
She knew exactly what would look good on you.

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:21.140
Of course. Mama's my producer, after all.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:23.890
Producer?

00:08:35.090 --> 00:08:37.850
You said she was a doctor, right?

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.530
Not a producer.

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:41.370
Yeah, she's a doctor,

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:46.820
but to me, she's a producer who produces cheerfulness for me.

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:49.430
You see,

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:57.450
when I was younger, I was really shy and couldn't play with the other kids in my class.

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:58.390
You were?

00:08:58.390 --> 00:08:59.620
Yeah.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:02.060
I didn't have many friends.

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.040
Really?

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.590
And also,

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:10.500
I was really jealous of how cute the other girls looked with all their pins and ribbons.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:13.400
I didn't know what to do, though.

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.950
They're all shining so brightly...

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:29.430
I wondered if I was from a different planet than everyone else or something.

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:34.880
Everyone was so cute, dazzling, and full of energy.

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:37.390
Meanwhile, I wasn't cute at all.

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:44.350
Then, one day, Mama asked me if I wanted her to tie my hair.

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:50.300
Mama, why are you tying my hair?

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:55.360
I forgot to cast a very important magic spell on you.

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:56.830
Magic spell?

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:02.350
It's a spell that'll make you full of energy and smile all over.

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:03.370
Oh?

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:06.840
So I can be cute, just like everyone else?

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.400
Of course you can!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.750
It's just that I forgot to cast the spell before.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.270
May you become cute~ {I would even suggest a ☆ or ♪}

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.250
May you become cute~

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:22.350
Is that the spell?

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:23.720
Yeah.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:25.600
Okay.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:28.140
Here, look.

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:33.110
It's like I'm not Kii!

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:37.400
You're still Kii. This is the real Kii.

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:42.070
The magic I cast awakened the true Kii.

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:47.400
And after that,

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:51.920
Mama did my hair whenever she wasn't working.

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:53.570
I see.

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:54.630
Yeah!

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.880
That's when I started to be my current cheerful self.

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:02.860
I chatted with Mama when she was working on my hair.

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:05.190
It really calmed me down.

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:08.190
And whenever I was sad,

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:11.120
those conversations cheered me up.

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:15.940
Oh my, oh my, oh my?

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.690
Something's on your mind!

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:20.860
May you become cute~

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.800
May you become cute~

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:25.950
See, you're cute!

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.160
Right?

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:29.410
Kii...

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:32.630
It'll be fine.

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:33.960
I'm on your side.

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:38.830
No matter what happens, I'll cast a spell on you to make it better.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:41.200
I'll cast it as many times as I need to.

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:43.410
Okay?

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:47.680
Okay.

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:49.990
Okay!

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:55.000
I guess that's where it started.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:12:00.150
As long as I said "ok-ok-okay", I could cheer myself up, even on the worst of days.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:03.570
So that's why you say "ok-ok-okay" all the time.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:05.070
Yeah!

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:06.870
It's the magic phrase that Mama gave me.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:13.580
Your mom must be worried about how you're doing right now.

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:18.180
Since you're not together, she can't tie your hair anymore.

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:28.390
Listen, honeys!

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:32.140
Today is the deadline to sign up for the Pon Pon Crepe audition!

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:36.900
Those of you still thinking about it better hurry up, yeah!

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:37.610
And so!

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:41.090
Let's give the current image girl, Kiriya-honey,

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:43.300
a resounding round of applause!

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.880
Yeah!

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:47.990
Good work, Aoi!

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.160
Thank you!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.790
Ah, I'm <i>so</i> looking forward to it.

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:59.740
I wonder who the next image girl will be.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:04.460
Aoi-senpai, in your eyes, what kind of girl will be chosen?

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:06.130
Let's see...

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:08.680
I'm here to ask about that too.

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:10.350
Seira-chan?

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:15.360
Our school's security is really tight, you know.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:16.900
How did you get them to let you in?

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:20.270
I just casually said that I was here to see some friends.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.950
I'm so happy! You think of us as friends!

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:25.180
Yeah...{you accidentally a .}

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:30.160
So I wanted to ask about the Pon Pon Crepe audition.

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:33.050
So you're going to enter, Seira?

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:34.410
No.

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:37.000
But I still want to know about it.

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:39.380
I want to know as much as I can.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.420
Like about the best way to win.

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:44.890
And to be blunt, what kind of girl will pass.

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:48.680
There's only one thing I can say.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:54.810
The most important thing is for the girl to really like Pon Pon Crepes.

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:57.890
She has to think they're delicious from the bottom of her heart.

00:13:58.670 --> 00:13:59.400
I see.

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:02.910
I feel a lot better now!

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:03.940
Thank you!

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:12.830
What's up, Seira?

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:15.750
What did you want to show me?

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:16.710
This.

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:19.210
Is that someone's data?

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:20.150
Yeah.

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:22.870
She's entering the Pon Pon Crepe audition.

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:25.430
Is there no picture?

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:26.560
No.

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:31.370
I wanted to ask if you could produce her to win the audition.

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:32.620
Is she a friend of yours?

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:34.350
Yeah. Think you can do it?

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:35.690
Of course!

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:37.750
Ok-ok-okay!

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:41.560
Just hold on a moment.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:45.630
I can't say anything specific since I haven't seen her, but...

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:46.820
There!

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:51.610
This is great!

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:52.830
She can definitely do it!

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:55.740
She'll be ok-ok-okay!

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:59.460
The part where she said she really liked Pon Pon Crepes is super important.

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:00.990
Yeah, isn't it? {wasn't?}

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:04.720
But she isn't very good at being in front of people.

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:07.050
She isn't very confident in her looks either.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:08.670
It'll be fine!

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:12.850
I'll produce her to shine brighter than anyone else.

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:16.620
Leave it to me! I'll find her a perfect dress!

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:19.230
I'll sign her up, then.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:20.270
Okay!

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:27.750
The audition's finally here.

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:30.240
Aoi, you're going to be a speaker there, right?

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.370
Yeah.

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:34.490
I'm as pumped up as I was for mine!

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:35.960
They're done, they're done!

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.120
This is the coord to go with!

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:39.770
Looks good to me.

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.290
Now go get ready.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:41.710
What?

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:44.290
You're entering the audition!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.460
I've even talked to the teachers about it.

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:48.970
What, what? What are you talking about?

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:50.720
I said, you're entering the audition!

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.010
Huh?

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:54.560
Kii, you said so yourself.

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:55.680
"She can definitely do it!"

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.370
"She'll be ok-ok-okay!"

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:01.510
You'll be produced by none other than Kii.

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:05.880
The data I gave you earlier was data I collected of you.

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:07.520
What?!

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:11.170
I can't do it!

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.910
No way, no way, no way!

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:14.530
I can't do the audition!

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:16.410
Don't say that.

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:20.660
I believe in your abilities as a producer.

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:25.880
Besides, next to your mom, I know you the best out of anyone in the world!

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:27.670
You'll do great.

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.430
Be the next Pon Pon Crepe image girl!

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:32.880
But...

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:39.540
My dream is to be a producer who can make any girl shine, just like Mama... {or go with cheerful}

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:44.850
That Mama of yours wants you to be as cute and cheerful as possible. {intentional use of Mama? jibun wo checkX3}

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:46.550
I'm sure of that.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:50.440
Step on stage.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:17:00.240
Am I... am I really going to do this?

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:04.580
No, I can't do it! {or make one sentence somehow}

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:11.590
Show your faraway mom just how cute and cheerful you are.

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:14.130
Number 37...

00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:17.320
You turned it into a card for me?

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:19.600
I asked a girl in the designer course to do it for me. {Sora episode when...} {seriously...}

00:17:20.170 --> 00:17:21.720
Seira...

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:25.770
Oh yeah...

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:29.770
How do I look?

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.250
You look wonderful!

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:33.360
Really?

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.310
You're really cute.

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:37.520
Mama?

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:41.280
Sorry, sorry.

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:43.370
I was just so happy.

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:49.790
You changed from your shy, 
withdrawn self into such a cute girl!

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:52.190
It makes me so happy.

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:55.550
Mama...

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:06.560
Kii?

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:10.440
I want to show her.

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:14.780
I want to show Mama how cute I am!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.900
That's the spirit!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:17.900
Here we go!

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:19.160
Ok...

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.160
Ok...

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.240
Okay!

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:28.400
Just la-la-la and enjoy yourself out there. {I get the feeling you're going to want to la-la-la things in the future}

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:29.670
Yeah!

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:26.330
Next up is entry number 51, {missed the beginning}

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:27.850
Saegusa Kii-san!

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:29.220
Kii-chan?

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:31.230
No way! She's so cute!

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:23.120
Did you hear?

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:24.510
They picked Kii-chan!

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:27.700
She's the new Pon Pon Crepe image girl!

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.030
Really?

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:30.310
Good for her.

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:32.630
She was the cutest one by far.

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:33.470
Yeah!

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:35.600
Just watching her made my heart race!

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:37.100
Congratulations.

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:42.360
From now on, you'll be working as an idol as well. Let's do our best.

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:44.820
Agreed!

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:48.620
Let's Aikatsu hard together.

00:21:49.510 --> 00:21:50.330
As idols!

00:21:57.110 --> 00:21:59.590
Ok-ok-okay!

00:21:59.590 --> 00:22:01.040
Yay!

00:22:08.500 --> 00:22:10.460
My, my.

00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:12.310
She looks just like you.

00:22:12.710 --> 00:22:14.060
You think so?

00:22:14.490 --> 00:22:15.830
I'm so happy.

00:23:55.960 --> 00:23:57.700
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism.

00:23:58.900 --> 00:24:02.700
You can change your image just by 
switching up your glasses or your hair.

00:24:02.700 --> 00:24:05.510
Your aura will change, and it'll be ok-ok-okay!

00:24:05.510 --> 00:24:07.080
Yeah, that's right.

00:24:08.020 --> 00:24:09.840
Try changing your image!

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:13.010
They say that romance is forbidden for idols... {I feel strongly about this line}

00:24:13.010 --> 00:24:14.550
